# --- public-issue scrub session scratch (node-local; never commit) ---------------
# One-off issue-text scrub/leak-audit session (tools/.issue_scrub.py + a .scrub_work/
# tree) dumps live GitHub issue bodies, leak-needle audits, and a private-preserve
# ledger to the repo root. These carry the very content the PUBLIC-SCRUB-POLICY gate
# exists to keep out of the public tree (live issue JSON, leaked-number lists,
# private backlinks), so they must never be staged. The scrub TOOL itself, if it is
# ever promoted to a tracked tool, lives under tools/ — this hides only the run state.
/.scrub_work/
